#: src/Plugin.php:142
msgid "Rank Math is active but its setup is not finished, and Fluffless SEO stays quiet while Rank Math is active. Finish the Rank Math setup, or deactivate Rank Math to let Fluffless SEO handle your search tags."
msgstr "Rank Math est actif, mais sa configuration n’est pas terminée, et Fluffless SEO reste silencieux tant que Rank Math est actif. Termine la configuration de Rank Math, ou désactive Rank Math pour laisser Fluffless SEO gérer tes balises de recherche."

